# Claude Code
# The root .claude/ is Claude Code's own state (sessions, history, backups,
# file-history, plugins, shell snapshots). Shared config lives in
# configs/claude/ and is linked into ~/.claude by `make claude`.
/.claude/
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/history.jsonl
**/.claude/sessions/
**/.claude/session-env/
**/.claude/file-history/
**/.claude/shell-snapshots/
**/.claude/backups/
**/.claude/cache/
**/.claude/projects/
**/.claude/.last-cleanup
